<navigator wx:if="{{outstandingCompensation}}" class="notice" url="/pages/orders/disputes?kind=compensation-receivables">有订单差额待补缴，查看明细 ›</navigator>
<view class="trade"><view class="feedback" wx:if="{{message}}">{{message}}<button bindtap="refresh">查询付款状态</button><button bindtap="recover">查询原操作</button></view><view class="blank" wx:if="{{!detail && !message}}"><mj-loading wx:if="{{busy}}" label="正在核实付款"/><text wx:else>暂无付款记录</text></view><block wx:if="{{detail}}"><view class="section hero"><view class="heading">{{detail.label}}</view><view wx:if="{{detail.canContinuePay}}">原付款剩余 {{remaining}}</view><view class="amount">¥{{detail.amounts.total}}</view><view class="muted">付款批次 {{detail.batchNo}}</view></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{detail.nextAction==='wait' && !outstandingCompensation}}">正在核实原付款，请勿重复支付。离开页面后平台仍会继续处理。</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{manual}}">本次自动查询已结束，状态仍以平台确认为准，可手动查询。</view><view class="section"><view class="row"><text>实收</text><text>¥{{detail.paid}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>已成功退回</text><text>¥{{detail.refunded}}</text></view><view class="muted">退款处理中和已成功到账分别展示，尚未收到回执不代表未付款。</view></view><view class="section" wx:if="{{detail.orderIds.length}}"><view class="heading">已生成 {{detail.orderIds.length}} 张订单</view><button wx:for="{{detail.orderIds}}" wx:key="*this" data-id="{{item}}" bindtap="order">查看工厂订单 {{index+1}} ›</button></view><view class="section" wx:if="{{detail.refundIds.length}}"><view class="heading">退款进度</view><button wx:for="{{detail.refundIds}}" wx:key="*this" data-id="{{item}}" bindtap="refund">查看原路退款 {{index+1}} ›</button></view><view wx:if="{{detail.couponReturn.status==='returned'}}" class="section" bindtap="coupon"><view class="heading">原优惠券已返还 ›</view><view>有效期至 {{detail.couponReturn.validUntilText}}</view></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">查询最新状态</button><view class="footer" wx:if="{{detail.canCancelPayment || detail.canContinuePay || detail.nextAction==='return_checklist'}}"><button wx:if="{{detail.canCancelPayment}}" class="secondary" bindtap="cancel" disabled="{{busy}}">取消付款</button><button wx:if="{{detail.canContinuePay}}" class="primary" bindtap="pay" disabled="{{busy}}">继续原付款</button><button wx:if="{{detail.nextAction==='return_checklist'}}" class="primary" bindtap="checklist">返回原清单</button></view></block>
<navigator wx:if="{{id}}" url="/pages/service/index?type=payment_order&id={{id}}">咨询平台客服 ›</navigator>
</view>
